1
00:00:00,579 --> 00:00:04,039
...there was no way he could've come up
with this whole experiment thing.

2
00:00:07,252 --> 00:00:08,922
(Sheldon:)Excuse me. Little idea?

3
00:00:09,088 --> 00:00:12,128
Yeah, he tried to explain it to me.
I didn't really understand it...

4
00:00:12,299 --> 00:00:15,259
(Sheldon:)Of course you didn't.
He said "little idea"?

5
00:00:15,427 --> 00:00:18,467
Oh. Well, no.
I mean, not in those words...

6
00:00:18,639 --> 00:00:20,519
In what words, then, exactly?

7
00:00:20,683 --> 00:00:22,183
The exact words aren't really...

8
00:00:22,351 --> 00:00:24,731
(Penny:)- It's more the spirit in which...
- What did he say?

9
00:00:24,895 --> 00:00:26,185
(Penny:)You had a lucky hunch.

10
00:00:27,606 --> 00:00:30,356
(Leonard(coming out of apartment):)I've been thinking.
Instead of arguing about this, why...?

11
00:00:30,526 --> 00:00:33,066
(Sheldon:)Don't you ever speak to me again.

12
00:00:34,780 --> 00:00:36,320
(Penny:)What...?

13
00:00:37,950 --> 00:00:40,080
Oh, he:

14
00:00:51,505 --> 00:00:53,885
(Leonard:)Okay, I'm leaving for the conference.

15
00:00:54,049 --> 00:00:58,219
- Have fun presenting my "lucky hunch."
- Sheldon, I didn't mean it like that.

16
00:00:58,387 --> 00:01:00,027
- Why did you say it?
- I don't know...

